  "name": "Hot Artichoke and Crab Dip",
  "subtitle": "A creamy baked dip with crab, artichokes, and Parmesan",
  "description": "Combine a rich seafood-and-artichoke mixture, top it with breadcrumbs, and bake until golden. Finish with fresh pepper and green onion.",
